Verify: [verify] represented by message flows from the collapsed IRB/IEC pool to the Regulatory authority and Investigator/institution pools (D1); [verify] 21 CFR defines neither 'serious' nor 'continuing'; no source maps iPD to this trigger (C-01)</bpmn:documentation>
