    <bpmn:task id="L4_05_A1" name="Assess potential serious breach">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: EUCTR Art. 52(2) (p. OJ L 158/40); EMA-SB SGlossary (p. printed 3/21); EMA-SB S3.2 (p. printed 5/21); EMA-SB S5.1 (p. printed 8/21; printed 7-8/21); EMA-SB S6.1 (p. printed 9/21); EMA-SB SAppII (p. printed 18/21); CTIS-BT-SB24 SSlide-33 (p. slide 33); EMA-SB SAppI-8.2 (p. printed 15/21); EMA-SB SAppI-8.4 (p. printed 15/21); EMA-SB S7 (p. printed 10/21)
